  "title": "ASE Concludes 2025 Youth Sustainability Innovation Competition, Celebrating the Next Generation of Changemakers",
  "summary": "Centered on \"Sustainable Innovation and Action Implementation,\" the competition awarded the top prize to the EcoSphereLab team from Taipei Municipal Zhong Zheng Senior High School. Winners will receive seed funding and a year-long incubation program to help turn their projects into impactful sustainable solutions. ASE emphasizes the importance of creativity, responsibility, and resilience in driving positive social change through education and innovation.",
